Package: themakR
Title: pkgdown Theme for the r-heller Package Suite
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    person("Raban", "Heller", email = "raban.heller@charite.de",
           role = c("aut", "cre"), comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0001-8006-9742"))
Description: Provides a custom pkgdown template that gives the r-heller family of
    R packages a shared visual identity: a single purple accent, monospace code
    styling, light and dark colour modes, and consistent navbar, hex, and footer
    treatment. Not intended for general use outside the r-heller suite.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
URL: https://github.com/CTTIR/themakR, https://cttir.github.io/themakR/
BugReports: https://github.com/CTTIR/themakR/issues
Encoding: UTF-8
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
Depends:
    R (>= 4.1)
Imports:
    pkgdown (>= 2.1.0)
Suggests:
    ggplot2,
    knitr,
    rmarkdown
VignetteBuilder: knitr
Config/Needs/website: CTTIR/themakR
Config/roxygen2/version: 8.0.0
